{
    "title": "Minifig Scan",
    "description": "This is a fan application, made by a fan and dedicated to fans.\r\n\r\nWith the introduction of the Series 25 (CMF), it is now possible to identify which figurine is inside the box by scanning the data code on the bottom of the box.\r\nThis has been confirmed to work with Series 26\r\n\r\nThis is not official information, so it may not always work, but many users have reported that the data codes match the figurine correctly.\r\n\r\nThis app allows you to quickly scan these data codes and reveal which figurine should be in the box.\r\n\r\nNote: The data code to scan (similar to a QR code / QRCode) to find the matching figurine is located below the boxes.",
